{
  "1": {
    "chapter_id": 1,
    "check_type": "dom",
    "title": "Chapter Test: CSS Introduction",
    "description": "Final task of chapter 1. Checks: connection, syntax, simple styles.",
    "practice": {
      "description": "Given HTML:\n```html\n<h1 class=\"title\">Title</h1>\n<p class=\"text\">Text</p>\n```\n\nIn `<style>` set:\n- `.title`: `color: red;`\n- `.text`: `color: blue;`\n\nVisible text: `Title Text`",
      "starter": "<h1 class=\"title\">Title</h1>\n<p class=\"text\">Text</p>\n<style>\n  /* TODO */\n</style>\n",
      "expected": "Title Text",
      "must_contain": ["<style", ".title", ".text", "color:", "red", "blue"]
    }
  },
  "2": {
    "chapter_id": 2,
    "check_type": "dom",
    "title": "Chapter Test: Selectors",
    "description": "Final task of chapter 2. Checks: tags, classes, id, descendants.",
    "practice": {
      "description": "Given HTML:\n```html\n<div id=\"main\">\n  <p class=\"note\">One</p>\n  <p class=\"note\">Two</p>\n</div>\n```\n\nIn `<style>`:\n1. `#main` — `background: lightgray;`\n2. `.note` — `color: green;`\n3. `#main p` — `font-size: 20px;`\n\nVisible text: `One Two`",
      "starter": "<div id=\"main\">\n  <p class=\"note\">One</p>\n  <p class=\"note\">Two</p>\n</div>\n<style>\n  /* TODO */\n</style>\n",
      "expected": "One Two",
      "must_contain": ["#main", ".note", "#main p", "background:", "color:", "font-size:"]
    }
  },
