      "description": "Given HTML:\n```html\n<h1>Title</h1>\n<p>Paragraph</p>\n```\n\nIn `<style>`:\n1. `body` — `font-family: Arial, sans-serif;`\n2. `h1` — `color: darkblue; text-align: center;`\n3. `p` — `font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6;`\n\nVisible text: `Title Paragraph`",
      "starter": "<h1>Title</h1>\n<p>Paragraph</p>\n<style>\n  /* TODO */\n</style>\n",
      "expected": "Title Paragraph",
      "must_contain": ["font-family", "h1", "darkblue", "text-align", "center", "font-size", "line-height"]
    }
