  "8": {
    "chapter_id": 8,
    "check_type": "dom",
    "title": "Chapter Test: Transitions and Animations",
    "description": "Final task of chapter 8. Checks: transition, transform, animation.",
    "practice": {
      "description": "Given HTML:\n```html\n<button class=\"btn\">Button</button>\n<div class=\"spin\">X</div>\n```\n\nIn `<style>`:\n1. `.btn` — `background: gray; color: white; padding: 8px 16px; border: none; transition: background 0.3s ease;`\n2. `.btn:hover` — `background: blue;`\n3. `.spin` — `display: inline-block; animation: rotate 2s linear infinite;`\n4. `@keyframes rotate { from { transform: rotate(0deg); } to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }`\n\nVisible text: `Button X`",
      "starter": "<button class=\"btn\">Button</button>\n<div class=\"spin\">X</div>\n<style>\n  /* TODO */\n</style>\n",
      "expected": "Button X",
      "must_contain": ["transition:", "0.3s", "ease", ".btn:hover", "@keyframes", "animation:", "transform:", "rotate"]
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "chapter_id": 9,
    "check_type": "dom",
    "title": "Chapter Test: Advanced CSS",
    "description": "Final task of chapter 9. Checks: :nth-child, CSS variables, calc, object-fit.",
    "practice": {
      "description": "Given HTML:\n```html\n<ul class=\"list\">\n  <li>One</li>\n  <li>Two</li>\n  <li>Three</li>\n</ul>\n<img class=\"photo\" src=\"pic.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\">\n```\n\nIn `<style>`:\n1. `:root` — `--accent: #007bff;`\n2. `.list li` — `padding: calc(8px + 0.5rem);`\n3. `.list li:nth-child(2)` — `color: var(--accent);`\n4. `.list li:not(:last-child)` — `border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;`\n5. `.photo` — `width: 200px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover;`\n\nVisible text: `One Two Three`",
      "starter": "<ul class=\"list\">\n  <li>One</li>\n  <li>Two</li>\n  <li>Three</li>\n</ul>\n<img class=\"photo\" src=\"pic.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\">\n<style>\n  /* TODO */\n</style>\n",
      "expected": "One Two Three",
      "must_contain": ["--accent", "var(--accent)", ":root", "calc(", "nth-child", ":not(", "object-fit:", "cover"]
    }
  },
